-- statement:
--   **`PartD` for the streams of a line.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegJPre7`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.JK.partD_line (h : SegReg P R s t lam w α)
--       (hK : K ≤ (LJ s t lam w).length) (hG : (LJ s t lam w).length ≤ G)
--       (hXb : Xb0 P w Bv ≤ Xb) (hBc : Bc0 s K G ≤ Bc) (hk : 2 * Xb + 2 * P + Bc + 6 ≤ k)
--       (v : List ℤ) (hv : v.length = G) (hvb : Bnd Bv v) :
--       PartD P k K G Xb Bc (jFs P R s t lam w α) (jBs P R s t lam w α)
--         (jCc P R s t lam w α K) v
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** `J` kernel precondition (JPre), part 7: `PartD` and `JPre` for the streams of a line
--
--   **`partD_line`**: in the regime `SegReg P R s t λ w α`, with `K ≤ |LJ| ≤ G`, for every gathered
--   row part `v` of length `G` with `Bnd Bv v`, the streams `jFs`, `jBs`, `jCc` of the line satisfy
--   `PartD P k K G Xb Bc … v` for every `Xb ≥ Xb0 P w Bv`, `Bc ≥ Bc0 s K G` and
--   `k ≥ 2 Xb + 2 P + Bc + 6`.
--
--   **`jPre_line`**: the same for both parts of a `GI` row, i.e. `JPre`.
